WEBVTT

00:38:25.461 --> 00:38:32.461
(Music)

00:38:32.920 --> 00:38:35.063
AG: Whether or not you're fighting fires,

00:38:35.087 --> 00:38:37.656
your job can leave you feeling burned out.

00:38:37.680 --> 00:38:40.926
Reducing the demands,
gaining control and finding support

00:38:40.950 --> 00:38:42.910
shouldn't be up to you alone,

00:38:42.934 --> 00:38:46.906
because burnout's not an epidemic
that's afflicting one generation.

00:38:46.930 --> 00:38:50.537
It's an organizational problem
that can affect any generation.

00:38:50.561 --> 00:38:51.582
(Music)

00:38:51.606 --> 00:38:52.756
If you feel exhausted

00:38:52.780 --> 00:38:55.126
and your workplace
isn't doing enough to help,

00:38:55.150 --> 00:38:57.646
you can help yourself, at least a little,

00:38:57.670 --> 00:39:00.424
by reflecting on why
you're in this job to begin with.